# Paint-list corpus fixtures. `.paintlist` is postcard bytes and must
# never be line-ending converted or merged. `.ops` goldens are compared
# byte-for-byte against `Scene::dump_ops()`, which emits LF, so they must
# not pick up CRLF on a Windows checkout.
*.paintlist binary
*.ops -text

